  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police's Criminal Investigation Agency, Bareskrim Polri, is conducting extensive searches across five locations in Bogor and Tangerang. The investigation follows allegations of a treason plot involving illegal surveillance aimed at President Prabowo. Reports suggest these sites, including a residence in Cibinong and a coffee shop, functioned as command posts for the suspected coordination. As part of the proceedings, police have identified new individuals connected to the case, specifically Brigadier General Tedjo and Senior Commissioner Iman Imanuddin. Authorities are currently processing evidence, including planning documents and banners seized during the operations, while continuing to interview 59 witnesses. Due to the ongoing nature of the evidence collection and documentation process, officials have decided to delay the official public case exposition. The investigation remains active as law enforcement officers continue to examine the materials and locations linked to the suspected activities.",
